mode: "100644"
text: "# The MATCH framework — rank an Instagram post/Reel in search\n\nInstagram is a **keyword search engine** now — keywords (not hashtags) drive discovery, and the visual must\n**match** the words. MATCH structures the SEO. The agent **researches + writes the search-first caption +\nspecs the on-screen/spoken keyword + advises the profile labels + alt text**; **WoopSocial publishes the\ncaption**; **the Name field, handle, bio, alt text, category, and auto-captions are native/advised**, and\non-screen text/audio come from other tools/the creator.\n\n## M — Mine the real queries\n- Scan **top-ranking Reels' captions + on-screen text** for recurring phrases; check competitors' **Name\n  fields**; use **Google \"People Also Ask\"** (Google indexes IG). Build a **cluster of 3–5 related terms.**\n  *Method only — can't query IG search or fabricate volume.*\n\n## A — Anchor the caption to search\n- Lead the **first sentence / first ~125 chars** with the **primary keyword** (natural long-tail matching\n  intent); weave the cluster; 3–5 hashtags as **labels.** This is the **publishable** SEO surface (WoopSocial\n  `content.text`).\n\n## T — Tag the profile labels\n- **Name field** = a search label (\"Name | Niche\"); a keyworded **handle**; an indexable **bio** (niche +\n  offer + location + CTA). *Profile-level — native/advised.*\n\n## C — Confirm the visual matches\n- **Alt text**, **on-screen text**, and the **first-3-seconds spoken keyword** all reinforce the topic — and\n  must **match the caption** (Computer Vision lowers ranking for a mismatch). **Auto-captions on**; **remove\n  other-platform watermarks.** *On-screen text → an image/video tool; the script → `reels-script`; alt text →\n  native.*\n\n## H — Harvest over time across search + Explore\n- **Search = keyword-driven; Explore = behaviour-driven.** Optimize for **saves/shares/watch-time**; the Raw\n  Content Revolution rewards **human voice + retention.** Compounds over **90–120 days.** No stuffing / no\n  irrelevant tags.\n\n## The SEO brief a request should fill\n```\nQUERIES: top-Reel scan + competitor Name fields + Google PAA -> a 3-5 keyword cluster (method only; no fabricated volume)\nCAPTION: primary keyword in the first sentence/125 chars; natural long-tail; cluster woven in; 3-5 hashtag labels (publishable: content.text)\nPROFILE: Name field \"Name | Niche\" + keyworded handle + indexable bio (advised; native to set)\nVISUAL MATCH: alt text + on-screen text + first-3-sec spoken keyword reinforce + MATCH the caption; auto-captions on; no watermark (-> reels-script + image/video tool)\nHARVEST: search + Explore; saves/shares/watch-time; compounds 90-120 days; no stuffing / irrelevant tags\nPUBLISH (WoopSocial): the caption (POST/REEL/STORY). Profile/alt/on-screen/audio/settings native/advised/other-tools; never fabricate volume.\n```\n"
